  JAX implementation of :obj:`numpy.tanh`.

  The hyperbolic tangent is defined by:

  .. math::

    tanh(x) = \frac{sinh(x)}{cosh(x)} = \frac{e^x - e^{-x}}{e^x + e^{-x}}

  Args:
